---
/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Therapy & clinical approach — ONE consolidated page.

   Deliberately a single page rather than a modality tree. Ten pages on CBT,
   DBT, EMDR and so on would each rest on 0-12 call mentions, eight of them on
   no verifiable evidence at all, and would compete with each other for the same
   thin intent. One page that answers what therapy here actually involves is
   worth more than ten that do not.

   EVERY FACT HERE IS CORROBORATED by admissions on recorded calls:
     "private rooms, twice-daily groups, one-on-one therapy, nightly AA"
     "...group therapy and then one individual therapy session a week"
     "her sponsor can come any day as long as they're doing step work together"
     "If you're feeling up to going and sitting in and participating in group,
      you'll be on the detox side"

   Note the individual-therapy frequency: ONE session a week. An earlier draft
   implied more. Publishing the real number is both honest and differentiating —
   most competitors imply daily one-to-one care.

   The group-therapy fear section exists because "do I have to talk in group" is
   the most common unspoken worry and a high-intent search in its own right.

   DO NOT add named modalities (CBT, EMDR, DBT...) without a named clinical
   confirmation, and record who confirmed it here when you do.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopBar from '../../components/TopBar.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';

import HubHero from '../../components/hub/HubHero.astro';
import TheWeek from '../../components/therapy/TheWeek.astro';
import TheGroupFear from '../../components/therapy/TheGroupFear.astro';
import TherapyQuestions from '../../components/therapy/TherapyQuestions.astro';

import Testimonials from '../../components/Testimonials.astro';
import VerifySection from '../../components/VerifySection.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';
import AdmissionsPath from '../../components/AdmissionsPath.astro';

const title = 'Therapy in Treatment: What It Actually Involves | Buena Vista, Chandler AZ';
const description =
  'Group therapy twice a day, a weekly one-to-one session with your own therapist, nightly AA and sponsors welcome any day. What therapy in residential treatment really looks like. Call (888) 362-5576.';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    ['How much therapy is there each day in rehab?',
     'At Buena Vista, group therapy runs twice a day, morning and afternoon, with an AA meeting in the evenings, plus a one-to-one session with your own therapist each week.'],
    ['Do I have to talk in group therapy?',
     'Not on the first day and not before you are ready. Sitting and listening is a normal way to start, and everyone in the room began the same way.'],
    ['Is there therapy during detox?',
     'Groups are available during detox if you feel up to attending, and skipped without comment if you do not. The first days are mostly about physical stabilization.'],
    ['Can my sponsor visit during treatment?',
     'Yes, on any day rather than only on visiting days, provided you are doing step work together.'],
  ].map(([q, a]) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a },
  })),
};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <TopBar />
  <Nav />

  <HubHero
    eyebrow="Therapy and clinical approach"
    title="Addiction Therapy in Chandler, Arizona"
    promise="Two groups a day, one session a week, and a meeting every night."
    points={[
      { text: 'Group therapy twice a day, morning and afternoon',
        d: 'M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z' },
      { text: 'One private session a week with your own therapist',
        d: 'M8.625 12a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0H8.25m4.125 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0H12m4.125 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0h-.375M21 12c0 4.556-4.03 8.25-9 8.25a9.764 9.764 0 01-2.555-.337A5.972 5.972 0 015.41 20.97a5.969 5.969 0 01-.474-.065 4.48 4.48 0 00.978-2.025c.09-.457-.133-.901-.467-1.226C3.93 16.178 3 14.189 3 12c0-4.556 4.03-8.25 9-8.25s9 3.694 9 8.25z' },
      { text: 'AA meetings here every night, not once a week',
        d: 'M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 017.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 00-7.843 4.582' },
      { text: 'Your sponsor can come in any day for step work',
        d: 'M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12z' },
      { text: 'Groups are optional in detox, and expected once you are steady',
        d: 'M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z' },
    ]}
    image="/Asset/stock%20photo/Desktop%20Dimensions/Facility/Shared%20commons%20area%20with%20clustered%20seating,%20dining%20nook,%20and%20residential%20finishes.png"
    alt="A commons area at Buena Vista with four armchairs clustered around a low table"
    caption="Four chairs and a low table. Most of the work happens in a room like this one."
  />

  <TheWeek />
  <TheGroupFear />
  <Testimonials />
  <VerifySection
    heading="Does insurance cover therapy in addiction treatment?"
    bullets={[
      'Therapy is part of your stay here, not billed as an extra',
      'We check your benefits while you are on the phone, usually in a few minutes',
      'It costs nothing, and you owe nothing either way',
      'Not in network with your plan? We will say so, and help you find who is',
    ]}
  />

  <AdmissionsPath heading="How to start treatment at Buena Vista" />
  <TherapyQuestions />

  <FinalCTA />

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} is:inline />
</Layout>
